  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Introduction"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "This eco-friendly water bladder is designed to be lightweight and foldable, saving space and making it ideal for outdoor activities or everyday use. Made from TPU, the material boasts excellent wear resistance, durability in low temperatures, and superior flexibility. It is also safe and free from harmful substances, offering a reliable and healthy choice for hydration."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Product Feature"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Lightweight, Foldable, and Space-Saving: Compact and lightweight design that folds for easy storage, saving space—perfect for outdoor adventures, hiking, and daily use."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Durable, Leak-Proof, and Secure Threaded Design: Made with high-strength TPU material and a threaded interface for a leak-proof and durable design, ensuring a worry-free experience."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Eco-Friendly, Safe, and Comfortable to Handle: Made from eco-friendly TPU and silicone materials, it is soft, flexible, and comfortable to use, making it suitable for various environments."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Considerations"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Avoid Long-Term Liquid Storage. Long-term liquid storage may lead to bacterial growth. Clean and air-dry the bladder after each use."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "The water bladder is not suitable for sugary drinks, as they can promote bacterial growth, mold, and odors, nor is it recommended for alcoholic beverages, which may affect the seal."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Additionally, avoid using hot liquids, as they can damage the water bladder, reduce its lifespan, or cause burns."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Frequently Asked Questions"
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "What should I do if the water bladder has an odor when first used? While the material of the water bladder is odorless, a slight smell may develop due to prolonged storage or sealing. To remove the odor, soak the bladder in a solution of lemon water or saline water for about an hour. Afterward, clean it thoroughly with warm water and let it air dry completely."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "Can the water bladder hold boiling water? The water bladder is designed to hold warm water, but it is recommended to keep the temperature below 55°C (131°F). Introducing boiling water (100°C or 212°F) may cause deformation, thermal damage, or reduce the product's lifespan."
    },
    {
      "kind": "bullet",
      "text": "What is the best way to clean the water bladder? Hand-wash the water bladder with warm water and a mild detergent. Avoid using a dishwasher, as high temperatures may damage the material. After washing, ensure the bladder is air-dried completely to prevent moisture buildup and potential mold growth."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<p> </p>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Documentation</h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<p class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile pct_downloadContent\" style=\"text-align: center; gap: 40px; display: flex; justify-content: center;\"><a href=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/08301fccb66d4d748f278bba078bf1b0/Water_Bladder.zip\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #333333; font-weight: 600; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 20px;\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"3D\" class=\"download_svg product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://store.bblcdn.com/s7/default/34cfd495f6e74bb59595d83a7b486516/3d.svg\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> 3D Model </a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\"></h2>\n<p> </p>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Introduction</h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<p>This eco-friendly water bladder is designed to be lightweight and foldable, saving space and making it ideal for outdoor activities or everyday use. Made from TPU, the material boasts excellent wear resistance, durability in low temperatures, and superior flexibility. It is also safe and free from harmful substances, offering a reliable and healthy choice for hydration.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Product Feature</h2>\n<div data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-page-id=\"V1EsdH1SWoZjxaxlwzpcRSchnqh\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IESydTIkjoRMLpxFaopc4M00nZc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Lightweight, Foldable, and Space-Saving</strong>: Compact and lightweight design that folds for easy storage, saving space—perfect for outdoor adventures, hiking, and daily use.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M7ovdF1ONoKGKnxEEK0cc5C1nCg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Durable, Leak-Proof, and Secure Threaded Design</strong>: Made with high-strength TPU material and a threaded interface for a leak-proof and durable design, ensuring a worry-free experience.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MjvRdHZ5soCnxRxiDY3cdYlHnRc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Eco-Friendly, Safe, and Comfortable to Handle</strong>: Made from eco-friendly TPU and silicone materials, it is soft, flexible, and comfortable to use, making it suitable for various environments.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"width: 99.9987%; height: 125.5px;\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19.5833px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 41.9171%; height: 19.5833px;\"><strong> Models</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 12.7413%; height: 19.5833px;\"><strong>Creators</strong></td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 44.8716%; height: 19.5833px;\"><b>Model Links</b></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 47.1667px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 41.9171%; height: 47.1667px;\">\n<div>\n<div data-line=\"true\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-zone-id=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<div>\n<div data-line=\"true\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-zone-id=\"0\">Mushroom Bottle</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 12.7413%; height: 47.1667px;\">\n<p>wuguigui</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"width: 44.8716%; height: 47.1667px;\"><a href=\"https://makerworld.